  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31b490125e05e96d",
      "translationZh": "花了3个月，烧掉800之后……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e8f186096d5f68f",
      "translationZh": "Unbounded Labs 自豪地推出 Bart，我们的复古大语言模型：拥有2.82B个参数，使用1931年之前写成的英文文本中的20.1B个词元从零开始训练。你现在就可以和它对话！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cb91e36078fde65",
      "translationZh": "演示：https://www.unboundedlab.com/chat/bartholomew",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c7c15de4fc12fa1",
      "translationZh": "文章：https://www.unboundedlab.com/blog/bartholomew",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96b9b90c886387ff",
      "translationZh": "为什么要做一个复古大语言模型？正如 Demis Hassabis 提出的那样，大语言模型能否得出与过去的伟大科学家相同的结论？虽然广义相对论超出了预算，但我们相信，推动这一领域的发展直指人工智能研究的核心。这些模型能够产生原创想法，还是只是在吐出下一个词元？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e03be335ff291e94",
      "translationZh": "这篇文章完整记录了我们的工作，涵盖语料库的来源及清洗方法、我们因没有现成基准而不得不自行构建的基准测试、每一项消融实验、各次训练运行、后训练，以及我们一路上犯过的错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d3008c533ef80ea",
      "translationZh": "“凡是我无法创造的，我就不理解。”这是 Richard Feynman 的一句话，我很喜欢。构建 Bart，是我们尝试真正理解大语言模型的方式，而不只是阅读关于它们的资料。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "933c5e5e75e8f5b7",
      "translationZh": "我们最引以为傲的是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6e6caca8f439f23",
      "translationZh": "在 Vintage CORE 上，是同等规模中表现最佳的复古基础模型，以更小的 token 预算领先于 GPT-1900",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14f53ab0cecbca86",
      "translationZh": "清洗了规模最大的复古数据集之一：Harvard 的 Institutional Books（242B->23B tokens）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "882f0277c698c3d9",
      "translationZh": "创建了 Vintage CORE，这是首套专为复古大语言模型打造的评测套件，包含 20 项基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3e9d7c8766be0fa",
      "translationZh": "在一张 H100 上进行了 10 小时的自主研究：完成了 100 次实验，发现了 26 项改进",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10ead4b67157d1b6",
      "translationZh": "发布了据我们所知规模最大的复古 SFT 数据集：416k 对经过评分的问答，均以 1930 年代之前的文本为依据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef367c0fe309a5c2",
      "translationZh": "在一张 H100 上用 5 天训练了最终模型，全程保持 60% 的 MFU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abf90644988c6601",
      "translationZh": "所有数据集、方法、训练代码、评测和训练运行记录均已开源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a041913611ef681",
      "translationZh": "我为我的团队感到自豪。我们构建的成果将推动复古 LLM 领域向前发展，也让我们作为研究者和普通人都获得了成长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65a7ab3eeb8801f2",
      "translationZh": "所有费用都由我们自己承担，到目前为止大约花了 807。资金是阻碍我们开展更大规模训练的主要因素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b538da21b2e7b7c",
      "translationZh": "所以我就直接开口了：我们正在为未来的工作寻求算力资助、资金支持和导师。如果你从事预训练、后训练，或者有闲置的 GPU，我们很想与你聊聊！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8984dc8ae42f50b",
      "translationZh": "我们相信，通过精心的数据集整理、领域专业知识和高效训练，我们能够在关键领域取得最先进的成果。对 Unbounded Labs 而言，这仅仅是个开始；我们看不到前方有任何界限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfafcf4450b92cc2",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/soggydoggy8 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
